{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1201755-FinanceMinisterLanFuoansSpeechatAPECFinanceMinistersMeeting\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Finance Minister Lan Fuo'an's Speech at APEC Finance Ministers Meeting</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1201748-APEC%E8%B2%A1%E9%95%B7%E6%9C%83%E8%AD%B0%E8%B6%B3%E6%9C%AC%E9%87%8D%E6%BA%AB%E8%B2%A1%E6%94%BF%E9%83%A8%E9%83%A8%E9%95%B7%E8%97%8D%E4%BD%9B%E5%AE%89%E8%87%B4%E9%96%8B%E5%B9%95%E8%BE%AD\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">APEC財長會議‧足本重溫｜財政部部長藍佛安致開幕辭</a></p><p></p><p>亞太經合組織(APEC)財長會在本港舉行，國家財政部部長藍佛安指，成員國應加強宏觀政策協調，推動經濟轉型。</p><p></p><p>國家財政部部長藍佛安表示：「當前國際經濟環境高度不確定性，各成員經濟體要強化自身宏觀經濟政策的穩健性，同時要加強政策溝通與協調，防範政策調整帶來的負面外溢效應，加快推進經濟轉型，增強經濟韌性，應把握數字化、綠色化轉型機遇，推動人工智能(AI)、數字經濟，綠色低碳等領域創新合作。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:04.472210+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":292,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T12:18:22.294756+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:56.417571+00:00","content_hash":"aa5006f50e80cfd61b6e1b1953602776545eb11c8f86a8748a23fd04132ef893","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}